    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "Words": "营业时间到了。让我们一起来复习一下怀特集团交易所的商业守则。"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50102,
    "Name": "艾拉斯卓",
    "NextDialog_ID": 50103,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "Words": "第一，绝对不能在商业谈判时意气用事；第二，绝对不原谅任何抬价溢价行为；第三，追求利润数据的绝对漂亮！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50103,
    "Name": "艾拉斯卓",
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Smile",
    "Words": "记住了吗？很好！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50104,
    "Name": "克里斯蒂安妮",
    "NextDialog_ID": 50105,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Smile",
    "Words": "你好，现在这里所有的贸易操作将由本小姐来负责！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50105,
    "Name": "克里斯蒂安妮",
    "NextDialog_ID": 50106,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Surprise",
    "Words": "为什么竟然露出这种震惊的表情！虽然本小姐确实志不在此，但是处理一手交钱一手交货这种事，是绝对没有问题的。"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50106,
    "Name": "克里斯蒂安妮",
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Shy",
    "Words": "起码……安妮每次为了报销小队军费而贴的发票还是很有条理的！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50107,
    "Name": "怀特·茜茜",
    "NextDialog_ID": 50108,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Firm",
    "Words": "哎……哎……尽管又上架了这么多好东西，可是交易流水还是不够理想啊……"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50108,
    "Name": "怀特·茜茜",
    "NextDialog_ID": 50109,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Surprise",
    "Words": "对了！要不然试试举办几个购物节吧！打几折比较有吸引力呢？八折……不！五折吧！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 50109,
    "Name": "怀特·茜茜",
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Smile",
    "Words": "所有人听着，立刻把店内的商品标价改为原来的两倍，在交易所外海报写上「全场五折大酬宾进行中」！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90101,
    "Name": "安杰丽卡",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90102,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Worry",
    "Words": "……找不到……找不到了！……刚刚研究完成的时空流浪法师识别器找不到了！"
