  {
    "ID": 90102,
    "Name": "安杰丽卡",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90103,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "Words": "嘛！到底是被谁拿走了，还是不小心掉到了别的时空里了……这下又要被骂了啦……嗯？"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90103,
    "Name": "安杰丽卡",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90104,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Surprise",
    "Words": "等等！只要我不说……就没人知道这个东西曾经存在过了吧！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90104,
    "Name": "安杰丽卡",
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Smile",
    "Words": "嘛……指挥官，你会替我保守秘密的，对吧？"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90105,
    "Name": "尤利娅",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90106,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "Words": "嗯……虽然只是偶尔在这里帮忙，但是也见到了不少有趣的孩子呢……"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90106,
    "Name": "尤利娅",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90107,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Smile",
    "Words": "如果要问印象最深的那一位……就是那位叫做奥利佛的王子吧，他经常在这里向其他英雄请教经验呢！"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90107,
    "Name": "尤利娅",
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "Words": "至于原因……似乎因为得知克洛泰尔先生的经历后，他认为自己也要多多吸取别人穿梭时空的失败教训才行。"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90108,
    "Name": "雪莉",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90109,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Sad",
    "Words": "好无聊啊……为什么我会被困在这里帮忙整理研究资料……"
  },
  {
    "ID": 90109,
    "Name": "雪莉",
    "NextDialog_ID": 90110,
    "Position": 1,
    "EnterType": 1,
    "IdleAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Normal",
    "IdleFacialAnimation": "idle_Dialog_Firm",
    "Words": "好·想·要·去·冒·险！"
